q2: offer several playback rates and play at the one the host sets

The AS IN format descriptor lists the module parameter p_srates (32000, 44100,
48000) when the configfs p_srate is among them, else p_srate alone as 5.10.21
does. The host's SET_CUR of the playback endpoint's sampling frequency
is taken when the format lists the rate: the next packets are sized
for it and the PCM opens at it. GET_CUR answers the rate in use. The module
parameters p_rate, rate_sets and rate_asked show the rate in use, how many such
SET_CURs came and the last rate asked (docs/iphone-mode.md#per-song-rate).
Applied by uac1_build.py after upstream's patches and its own u_audio.c changes.

